OL,3,GNEWSANew chief outlines main issues
OL,4,Afacing Isle of Man
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief minister of the Isle of Man
OL,7,Fhas said reliance on imports, risks of
OL,8,Ftransport disruption, and pressure on
OL,9,Fhousehold finances are among the main
OL,10,Fchallenges facing the new government.
OL,12,FThe warning came after recent storms
OL,13,Fdisrupted sea and air connections, and
OL,14,Fquestions over how prepared the island
OL,15,Fis for more prolonged supply problems.
OL,17,FChris Thomas outlined plans to
OL,18,Fstrengthen food security and
OL,19,Fconnectivity, but said emergency
OL,20,Fpreparedness was not among his top five
OL,21,Fpriorities.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
