OL,3,GNEWSANew chief outlines main issues
OL,4,Afacing Isle of Man
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief minister, ard-shirveishagh in
OL,7,FManx, said: "It is a serious issue. We
OL,8,Fneed to improve connectivity through
OL,9,Fthe airport and through Douglas
OL,10,FHarbour."
